msgid ""
"  codecs web   Web video in Firefox only. Replaces Fedora's empty OpenH264 stand-in with\n"
"               Cisco's OpenH264 from Fedora's Cisco repository, under Cisco's own H.264\n"
"               patent license.\n"
"  codecs full  Everything. Replaces Fedora's free ffmpeg libraries with the full ffmpeg,\n"
"               x264 and x265 from RPM Fusion, the source standard Fedora uses."
msgstr ""
"  codecs web   Webvideo slegs in Firefox. Vervang Fedora se leë OpenH264-plaasvervanger met\n"
"               Cisco se OpenH264 uit Fedora se Cisco-bewaarplek, onder Cisco se eie\n"
"               H.264-patentlisensie.\n"
"  codecs full  Alles. Vervang Fedora se gratis ffmpeg-biblioteke met die volledige ffmpeg,\n"
"               x264 en x265 van RPM Fusion, die bron wat gewone Fedora gebruik."

msgid ""
"  evenkeel-os-packages install [FILE]   install an .rpm or .deb (no FILE: pick one from Downloads)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages remove           remove an app installed this way\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check FILE       say what a package needs, without installing anything\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages repair           set a broken app box up again (--if-broken: only if one does not work)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages login            choose box apps that start when you log in\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages windows FILE     a Windows .exe or .msi: offer a Linux app that does its job\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check-windows FILE  say what a Windows file is and what would be offered, without any window\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages zoom LINK        a Zoom \"open the app\" link: open the meeting in Zoom's web version, in Chrome\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages vpn [NAME]       add a VPN from its company's own download source (mullvad, proton, ivpn,\n"
"                                        nordvpn; no NAME: pick one)"
msgstr ""
"  evenkeel-os-packages install [FILE]   installeer 'n .rpm of .deb (geen FILE nie: kies een uit Aflaaie)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages remove           verwyder 'n toepassing wat op hierdie manier geïnstalleer is\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check FILE       sê wat 'n pakket nodig het, sonder om enigiets te installeer\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages repair           stel 'n stukkende toepassingsboks weer op (--if-broken: slegs as een nie werk nie)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages login            kies boks-toepassings wat begin wanneer u aanmeld\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages windows FILE     'n Windows-.exe of -.msi: bied 'n Linux-toepassing aan wat dieselfde werk doen\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check-windows FILE  sê wat 'n Windows-lêer is en wat aangebied sou word, sonder enige venster\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages zoom LINK        'n Zoom-\"maak die toepassing oop\"-skakel: maak die vergadering in Zoom se webweergawe oop, in Chrome\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages vpn [NAME]       voeg 'n VPN by vanaf die maatskappy se eie aflaaibron (mullvad, proton, ivpn,\n"
"                                        nordvpn; geen NAME nie: kies een)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" comes with Fedora. The trusted list is rebuilt from Fedora's "
"current list at every start, so an update replaces or drops it; keep "
"automatic updates on. If this alert stays after updating and restarting, tell"
" your helper."
msgstr ""
"\"{name}\" kom saam met Fedora. Die vertroude lys word by elke opstart vanaf "
"Fedora se huidige lys herbou, sodat 'n bywerking dit vervang of laat vaar; "
"hou outomatiese bywerkings aan. As hierdie waarskuwing bly nadat u bygewerk "
"en herbegin het, vertel dit vir u helper."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" has expired, but its file ({file}) holds {n} certificate, and "
"removing it would remove them all, the good ones too. Tell your helper."
msgid_plural ""
"\"{name}\" has expired, but its file ({file}) holds {n} certificates, and "
"removing it would remove them all, the good ones too. Tell your helper."
msgstr[0] ""
"\"{name}\" het verval, maar die lêer ({file}) bevat {n} sertifikaat, en as u "
"dit verwyder, sal u hulle almal verwyder – ook die goeies. Vertel dit vir u "
"helper."
msgstr[1] ""
"\"{name}\" het verval, maar die lêer ({file}) bevat {n} sertifikate, en as u "
"dit verwyder, sal u hulle almal verwyder – ook die goeies. Vertel dit vir u "
"helper."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" has expired. It was added in a way Wheelhouse can't remove; tell "
"your helper."
msgstr ""
"\"{name}\" het verval. Dit is op 'n manier bygevoeg wat Wheelhouse nie kan "
"verwyder nie; vertel dit vir u helper."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "\"{name}\" is removed and no longer trusted."
msgstr "\"{name}\" is verwyder en word nie meer vertrou nie."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" was added to this computer and expired on {date}. An expired "
"certificate shouldn't be relied on. Remove it if you no longer need it; if "
"you do, ask whoever gave it to you for a new one. Removing it needs your "
"password."
msgstr ""
"\"{name}\" is by hierdie rekenaar gevoeg en het op {date} verval. 'n Vervalde"
" sertifikaat moet nie vertrou word nie. Verwyder dit as u dit nie meer nodig "
"het nie; as u dit wel nodig het, vra die persoon wat dit aan u gegee het vir "
"'n nuwe een. Om dit te verwyder, het u u wagwoord nodig."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" was added to this computer and expires on {date}. Ask whoever gave"
" it to you for a new one before then."
msgstr ""
"\"{name}\" is by hierdie rekenaar gevoeg en verval op {date}. Vra die persoon"
" wat dit vir u gegee het, voor daardie tyd vir 'n nuwe een."

#. Translators: a weekday and date ("Thursday, November 26"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%A, %B %-d"
msgstr "%A %-d %B"

#. Translators: a date: month and day ("November 26"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%B %-d"
msgstr "%-d %B"

#. Translators: a date and a 12-hour time ("November 26, 7:02 PM"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%B %-d, %-I:%M %p"
msgstr "%-d %B %-I:%M %p"

#. Translators: a date and a 24-hour time ("November 26, 19:02"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%B %-d, %H:%M"
msgstr "%-d %B %H:%M"

msgid "(nothing was printed)"
msgstr "(geen afvoer nie)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "- and {n} more"
msgid_plural "- and {n} more"
msgstr[0] "- en nog {n}"
msgstr[1] "- en nog {n}"

msgid ""
"1.00 is the normal size. Large text in Settings, Accessibility sets 1.25."
msgstr ""
"1,00 is die normale grootte. Groot teks in Instellings, Accessibility "
"(Toeganklikheid), stel dit op 1,25."

msgid "12 hour"
msgstr "12-uur"

msgid "24 hour"
msgstr "24-uur"

msgid ""
"A .deb driver can't be installed. The window says how to get the .rpm from "
"the maker."
msgstr ""
"'n .deb-drywer kan nie geïnstalleer word nie. Die venster sê hoe u die .rpm "
"van die vervaardiger kan kry."

msgid "A USB mouse works."
msgstr "'n USB-muis werk."

msgid "A USB webcam works."
msgstr "'n USB-webkamera werk."

msgid "A VPN"
msgstr "'n VPN"

msgid "A Windows program you downloaded (.exe or .msi)"
msgstr "'n Windows-program wat u afgelaai het (.exe of .msi)"

msgid "A background service fails"
msgstr "'n Agtergronddiens misluk"

msgid ""
"A background service that runs on this computer fails to start (the mobile "
"broadband service, or the graphics switching service)."
msgstr ""
"'n Agtergronddiens wat op hierdie rekenaar loop, kan nie begin nie (die "
"mobiele breëbanddiens of die grafiese skakeldiens)."

msgid "A bottom bar, with a start menu on the logo"
msgstr "'n Onderste balk, met 'n beginkieslys op die logo"

msgid "A broken app box"
msgstr "'n Stukkende toepassingsboks"

msgid "A built-in camera of the newer laptop kind was found."
msgstr "'n Ingeboude kamera van die nuwer tipe skootrekenaar is gevind."

msgid "A café, hotel, airport, or anywhere else. Nothing gets in."
msgstr "'n Koffiewinkel, hotel, lughawe, of enige ander plek. Niks kom in nie."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "A certificate needs attention"
msgid_plural "{n} certificates need attention"
msgstr[0] "'n Sertifikaat benodig aandag"
msgstr[1] "{n} sertifikate benodig aandag"

msgid ""
"A change to the boot options is waiting. It starts at your next restart. It isn't an update.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't want it: Don't use it. The computer starts with the boot options it has now, and automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Or Keep it."
msgstr ""
"'n Verandering aan die opstartopsies wag. Dit begin by u volgende herbegin. Dit is nie 'n bywerking nie.\n"
"\n"
"As u dit nie wil hê nie: Moenie dit gebruik nie. Die rekenaar begin met die opstartopsies wat dit nou het, en outomatiese bywerkings word nie onderbreek nie.\n"
"\n"
"Of Hou dit."

msgid "A device"
msgstr "'n Toestel"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "A device lost its driver ({driver})"
msgstr "'n Toestel het sy drywer verloor ({driver})"

msgid "A disk is hidden."
msgstr "'n Skyf is verborge."

msgid "A driver file from the maker"
msgstr "'n Drywerlêer van die vervaardiger"

msgid "A file of recent errors to email to your helper"
msgstr "'n Lêer met onlangse foute om per e-pos aan u helper te stuur"

msgid "A full name can't have : or , in it."
msgstr "'n Volle naam mag nie : of , daarin hê nie."

msgid "A graphics chip has no driver."
msgstr "'n Grafiese skyfie het geen drywer nie."

msgid ""
"A network is only needed for automatic time and time zone. To use Wi-Fi, "
"click a network. Or click Next to go on without it."
msgstr ""
"'n Netwerk is slegs nodig vir outomatiese tyd en tydsone. Om Wi-Fi te "
"gebruik, klik op 'n netwerk. Of klik op Volgende om sonder dit voort te gaan."

msgid ""
"A new layout shows after you log out and back in. It changes only your own "
"desktop."
msgstr ""
"'n Nuwe uitleg verskyn nadat u afgemeld en weer aangemeld het. Dit verander "
"slegs u eie werkskerm."

msgid "A new system is ready."
msgstr "'n Nuwe stelsel is gereed."

msgid "A new system is ready. Restart to use it."
msgstr "'n Nuwe stelsel is gereed. Herbegin om dit te gebruik."

msgid ""
"A new system version is used from the next restart. Keep working, and restart"
" when it suits you."
msgstr ""
"'n Nuwe stelselweergawe word vanaf die volgende herbegin gebruik. Werk gerus "
"voort, en herbegin wanneer dit u pas."

msgid ""
"A new version also goes back if something that worked before is broken after "
"you log in, like sound, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, the camera or printing. Unplugged "
"or switched-off things don't count."
msgstr ""
"'n Nuwe weergawe gaan ook terug as iets wat vantevore gewerk het, ná u "
"aanmelding nie meer werk nie – byvoorbeeld klank, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, die "
"kamera of drukwerk. Dinge wat uitgeprop of afgeskakel is, tel nie."

msgid "A new version is ready"
msgstr "'n Nuwe weergawe is gereed"

msgid ""
"A note at the next login says so and names what broke, and automatic updates "
"pause for 3 days."
msgstr ""
"'n Kennisgewing by die volgende aanmelding sê dit en noem wat gebreek het, en"
" outomatiese bywerkings word vir 3 dae onderbreek."

msgid ""
"A rollback test copy is running. Restart first, so the computer goes back to "
"the usual version."
msgstr ""
"'n Toetskopie vir terugrol word uitgevoer. Herbegin eers, sodat die rekenaar "
"teruggaan na die gewone weergawe."

msgid "A security certificate expired, expires within 30 days, or was removed."
msgstr ""
"'n Sekuriteitsertifikaat het verval, verval binne 30 dae, of is verwyder."

msgid "A slideshow of your own pictures"
msgstr "'n Skyfievertoning van u eie foto's"

msgid "A sound chip was found, but it didn't start."
msgstr "'n Klankskyfie is gevind, maar dit het nie begin nie."

msgid "A start-up check fails"
msgstr "'n Opstartkontrole misluk"

msgid ""
"A start-up check fails on purpose. The computer restarts by itself within "
"seconds, twice, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"'n Opstartkontrole misluk doelbewus. Die rekenaar herbegin binne sekondes "
"vanself, twee keer, en die derde opstart is weer op hierdie weergawe."

msgid "A system service fails"
msgstr "'n Stelseldiens misluk"

msgid "A system update is also waiting for a restart."
msgstr "'n Stelselbywerking wag ook op 'n herbegin."

msgid "A tool"
msgstr "'n Hulpmiddel"

msgid "A top bar, with the logo menu at the top left"
msgstr "'n Boonste balk, met die logo-kieslys links bo"

msgid ""
"A user name uses small letters, digits, - and _, and starts with a letter."
msgstr ""
"'n Gebruikersnaam gebruik klein letters, syfers, - en _, en begin met 'n "
"letter."

msgid ""
"A wired network is set to Home, so this happens on any cable you plug in."
msgstr ""
"'n Bedrade netwerk is op Tuis gestel, so dit gebeur met enige kabel wat u "
"inprop."

msgid "A wireless chip was found, but it didn't start."
msgstr "'n Draadlose skyfie is gevind, maar dit het nie begin nie."

msgid "A wireless chip was found, with no driver for it."
msgstr "'n Draadlose skyfie is gevind, maar daar is geen drywer daarvoor nie."

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off Panel Replay"
msgstr "AMD: flikker, skakel Panel Replay af"

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off Panel Self Refresh"
msgstr "AMD: flikker, skakel Panel Self Refresh af"

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off both"
msgstr "AMD: flikker, skakel beide af"

msgid "AMD: screen dims or shifts colors on its own"
msgstr "AMD: skerm verdof of kleure verander vanself"

msgid "AMD: white flickering"
msgstr "AMD: wit flikkering"

msgid ""
"About 20 seconds after the login screen shows, the computer locks up. Hold "
"the power button until it turns off, then turn it on. After the second "
"freeze, the next start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Ongeveer 20 sekondes nadat die aanmeldskerm verskyn, vries die rekenaar. Hou "
"die aan/af-knoppie in totdat dit afskakel, en skakel dit dan weer aan. Ná die"
" tweede keer wat dit vries, is die volgende opstart weer op hierdie weergawe."

msgid "About it"
msgstr "Meer inligting"

msgid "About this driver"
msgstr "Oor hierdie drywer"

msgid "Accent color and wallpaper"
msgstr "Aksentkleur en agtergrond"

msgid "Account"
msgstr "Rekening"

msgid "Add"
msgstr "Voeg by"

msgid "Add a folder"
msgstr "Voeg 'n gids by"

msgid "Add a folder and set the sharing password below."
msgstr "Voeg 'n gids by en stel die deelwagwoord hieronder."

msgid "Add a folder from your home folder."
msgstr "Voeg 'n gids uit u tuisgids by."

msgid "Add a printer"
msgstr "Voeg 'n drukker by"

msgid "Add a setting, like amdgpu.abmlevel=0"
msgstr "Voeg 'n instelling by, soos amdgpu.abmlevel=0"

msgid "Add anyway"
msgstr "Voeg tog by"

msgid "Add it"
msgstr "Voeg dit by"

msgid ""
"Add it only if you know you need it. If the computer then won't start, "
"automatic rollback goes back to the version before."
msgstr ""
"Voeg dit slegs by as u weet u het dit nodig. As die rekenaar dan nie wil "
"begin nie, gaan die outomatiese terugrol terug na die vorige weergawe."

msgid "Add or remove an app's hardware rules"
msgstr "Voeg 'n toepassing se hardeware-reëls by of verwyder dit"

msgid "Add or remove media codecs"
msgstr "Voeg mediakodeks by of verwyder dit"

msgid "Add the media codecs"
msgstr "Voeg die mediakodeks by"

msgid "Add to the system"
msgstr "Voeg by die stelsel"

msgid "Add video and audio codecs"
msgstr "Voeg video- en audiokodeks by"

msgid "Add, turn on or remove a VPN or an app's background service"
msgstr ""
"Voeg 'n VPN of 'n toepassing se agtergronddiens by, skakel dit aan of "
"verwyder dit"

msgid "Added by you"
msgstr "Deur u bygevoeg"

msgid "Added to this computer"
msgstr "By hierdie rekenaar gevoeg"

msgid "Adding a printer, and printer driver files from the maker"
msgstr "'n Drukker byvoeg, en drukkerdrywerlêers van die vervaardiger"

msgid ""
"Adding the desktop parts apps expect (progress windows and notifications)"
msgstr ""
"Besig om die werkskermonderdele by te voeg wat toepassings verwag "
"(vorderingsvensters en kennisgewings)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding the download source {name}"
msgstr "Besig om die aflaaibron {name} by te voeg"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system"
msgstr "Besig om {title} by die stelsel te voeg"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system from Fedora. A progress window shows it."
msgstr ""
"Besig om {title} vanaf Fedora by die stelsel te voeg. 'n Vorderingsvenster "
"wys dit."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system from Fedora. This can take a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"Besig om {title} vanaf Fedora by die stelsel te voeg. Dit kan 'n paar minute "
"neem."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system. A progress window shows it."
msgstr "Besig om {title} by die stelsel te voeg. 'n Vorderingsvenster wys dit."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system. This can take a few minutes."
msgstr "Besig om {title} by die stelsel te voeg. Dit kan 'n paar minute neem."

msgid "Administrator"
msgstr "Administrateur"

msgid "Administrator account (root)"
msgstr "Administrateurrekening (root)"

msgid "Administrator: no."
msgstr "Administrateur: nee."

msgid "Administrator: yes."
msgstr "Administrateur: ja."

msgid ""
"After a BIOS update, it may ask for the disk password again. Turn it on again"
" here."
msgstr ""
"Ná 'n BIOS-bywerking kan dit weer vra vir die skyfwagwoord. Skakel dit hier "
"weer aan."

msgid ""
"After an undo, so the same update doesn't come straight back. They turn back "
"on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Ná 'n ongedaanmaak, sodat dieselfde bywerking nie dadelik weer terugkom nie. "
"Hulle skakel vanself weer aan."

msgid "After the restart, you will be asked to add your printer."
msgstr "Ná die herbegin sal u gevra word om u drukker by te voeg."

msgid ""
"After the restart, you'll be asked for your password once, to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Ná die herbegin sal u een keer gevra word vir u wagwoord om dit aan te "
"skakel."

msgid "After the restart, you'll get a message when it's ready."
msgstr "Ná die herbegin sal u 'n boodskap kry wanneer dit gereed is."

msgid "Alpha"
msgstr "Alfa"

msgid "Also let in, on Home"
msgstr "Laat ook in, op Tuis"

msgid ""
"Alt+Tab switches between apps. Alt and the key above Tab switches between "
"windows of the same app."
msgstr ""
"Alt+Tab wissel tussen toepassings. Alt en die sleutel bo Tab wissel tussen "
"vensters van dieselfde toepassing."

msgid ""
"An .rpm or .deb installs the app. An .exe or .msi gets its Linux version."
msgstr ""
"'n .rpm- of .deb-lêer installeer die toepassing. 'n .exe- of .msi-lêer kry sy"
" Linux-weergawe."

msgid "An app that comes as a .rpm or .deb file"
msgstr "'n Toepassing wat as 'n .rpm- of .deb-lêer kom"

msgid "An office. Nothing gets in, and your folders aren't shared."
msgstr "'n Kantoor. Niks kom in nie, en u gidse word nie gedeel nie."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An update from {staged} is waiting. It starts at your next restart. The version you're using now is from {booted}.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't want it: Don't use it. Your computer keeps the version it has now. A boot options change made since the update came is dropped with it."
msgstr ""
"'n Bywerking van {staged} wag. Dit begin by u volgende herbegin. Die weergawe wat u nou gebruik, is van {booted}.\n"
"\n"
"As u dit nie wil hê nie: Moenie dit gebruik nie. U rekenaar hou die weergawe wat dit nou het. 'n Verandering aan die opstartopsies wat sedert die bywerking gekom het, word saam daarmee verwyder."

msgid "An update is waiting for a restart. Restart first, then run the test."
msgstr ""
"'n Bywerking wag vir 'n herbegin. Herbegin eers, en voer dan die toets uit."

msgid "Another disk is hidden by a BIOS setting."
msgstr "Nog 'n skyf is deur 'n BIOS-instelling verborge."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Another install or removal is running ({doing}). This waits for it to finish,"
" then goes on."
msgstr ""
"Nog 'n installasie of verwydering is besig ({doing}). Dit wag totdat dit "
"klaar is, en gaan dan voort."

msgid ""
"Another version is set to start at your next restart (after Undo the last "
"update, or picking a version in the boot menu), so the test wouldn't test "
"anything. Restart first, then run the test."
msgstr ""
"Nog 'n weergawe is ingestel om by u volgende herbegin te begin (ná Maak die "
"laaste bywerking ongedaan, of nadat 'n weergawe in die opstartkieslys gekies "
"is), sodat die toets niks sou toets nie. Herbegin eers, en voer dan die toets"
" uit."

msgid "App"
msgstr "Toepassing"

msgid "App, game or port number"
msgstr "Toepassing, speletjie of poortnommer"

msgid ""
"Applies them at login: the next slide for \"at each login\", and dark or "
"light for the time of day"
msgstr ""
"Pas dit toe by aanmelding: die volgende skyfie vir \"by elke aanmelding\", en"
" donker of lig vir die tyd van die dag"

msgid "Apps"
msgstr "Toepassings"

msgid "Apps and ports let in"
msgstr "Toepassings en poorte wat ingelaat word"

msgid "Apps from Bazaar have this setting inside the app."
msgstr "Toepassings van Bazaar het hierdie instelling binne die toepassing."

msgid "Apps from Bazaar update on their own. Remove them in Bazaar too."
msgstr ""
"Toepassings van Bazaar word vanself bygewerk. Verwyder hulle ook in Bazaar."

msgid "Apps from Bazaar: open Bazaar and remove it there."
msgstr "Toepassings van Bazaar: maak Bazaar oop en verwyder dit daar."

msgid ""
"Apps from a file, Get a VPN or a Windows program: Wheelhouse, Apps, Remove "
"apps."
msgstr ""
"Toepassings vanaf 'n lêer, Kry 'n VPN of 'n Windows-program: Wheelhouse, "
"Toepassings, Verwyder toepassings."

msgid ""
"Apps from a file: open Wheelhouse, Apps, Start apps at login, and pick the "
"app. Picking it again stops it."
msgstr ""
"Toepassings vanaf 'n lêer: Maak Wheelhouse oop, gaan na Toepassings, dan na "
"Begin toepassings by aanmelding, en kies die toepassing. As u dit weer kies, "
"stop dit."

msgid "Apps from package files"
msgstr "Toepassings uit pakketlêers"

msgid "Apps from their own download sources"
msgstr "Toepassings vanaf hul eie aflaaibronne"

msgid "Apps you added from files, Get a VPN or Windows programs"
msgstr ""
"Toepassings wat u uit lêers bygevoeg het, Kry 'n VPN of Windows-programme"

msgid "April"
msgstr "April"

msgid ""
"ArtCraft's downloads can't be reached right now. Check the internet "
"connection and try again."
msgstr ""
"ArtCraft se aflaaie is tans nie bereikbaar nie. Gaan die internetverbinding "
"na en probeer weer."

msgid "ArtCraft's signature is checked first, and it updates once a day."
msgstr ""
"ArtCraft se handtekening word eers nagegaan, en dit word een keer per dag "
"bygewerk."

msgid ""
"Asks once whether a password Wi-Fi or wired network is Home, Work or a Public"
" place"
msgstr ""
"Vra een keer of 'n Wi-Fi- of bedrade netwerk met 'n wagwoord Tuis, Werk of 'n"
" Openbare plek is"

msgid "At each login"
msgstr "By elke aanmelding"

