msgstr "Outomatiese bywerkings"

msgid "Automatic updates are back on."
msgstr "Outomatiese bywerkings is weer aan."

msgid "Automatic updates are back on. The next daily update runs as normal."
msgstr ""
"Outomatiese bywerkings is weer aan. Die volgende daaglikse bywerking loop "
"soos gewoonlik."

msgid "Automatic updates are off"
msgstr "Outomatiese bywerkings is af"

msgid "Automatic updates are off. Run System Update yourself to update."
msgstr ""
"Outomatiese bywerkings is af. Voer Stelselbywerking self uit om by te werk."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates are off: nothing updates until you run System Update yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Turn on. Everything then updates by itself every day at 4 am, and updates fix security problems."
msgstr ""
"Outomatiese bywerkings is af: niks word bygewerk totdat u self Stelselbywerking laat loop nie.\n"
"\n"
"Aanbeveel: Skakel aan. Alles word dan elke dag om 4 vm. vanself bygewerk, en bywerkings los sekuriteitsprobleme op."

msgid "Automatic updates are on."
msgstr "Outomatiese bywerkings is aan."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates are on: everything updates by itself every day at 4 am.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Keep them on. Updates fix security problems.\n"
"\n"
"Or Turn off: nothing updates until you run System Update yourself."
msgstr ""
"Outomatiese bywerkings is aan: alles word elke dag om 4 vm. vanself bygewerk.\n"
"\n"
"Aanbeveel: Hou hulle aan. Bywerkings los sekuriteitsprobleme op.\n"
"\n"
"Of Skakel af: niks word bygewerk totdat u self Stelselbywerking laat loop nie."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Automatic updates are paused until {day}"
msgstr "Outomatiese bywerkings is onderbreek tot {day}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Automatic updates are paused until {day}, after an undo, so the bad update doesn't come back. They turn back on by themselves.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Keep the pause.\n"
"\n"
"Or Resume now: the next daily update runs as normal. Or Turn off: nothing updates until you run System Update yourself."
msgstr ""
"Outomatiese bywerkings is tot {day} onderbreek, ná 'n ongedaanmaak, sodat die slegte bywerking nie terugkom nie. Hulle skakel vanself weer aan.\n"
"\n"
"Aanbeveel: Hou die onderbreking.\n"
"\n"
"Of Hervat nou: die volgende daaglikse bywerking loop soos gewoonlik. Of Skakel af: niks word bygewerk totdat u self Stelselbywerking laat loop nie."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Automatic updates are paused until {day}, so the bad update doesn't come "
"back. They turn back on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Outomatiese bywerkings is tot {day} onderbreek, sodat die slegte bywerking "
"nie weer terugkom nie. Hulle skakel vanself weer aan."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Automatic updates are paused until {day}, so the same update doesn't come "
"straight back. They turn back on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Outomatiese bywerkings is tot {day} onderbreek, sodat dieselfde bywerking nie"
" dadelik weer kom nie. Hulle skakel vanself weer aan."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates are still paused after the undo. Resume them in Automatic "
"updates."
msgstr ""
"Outomatiese bywerkings is steeds onderbreek ná die ongedaanmaak. Hervat dit "
"in Outomatiese bywerkings."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates could not be paused, so the next one may bring the update "
"back. If it does, turn off Automatic updates in Wheelhouse and tell your "
"helper."
msgstr ""
"Outomatiese bywerkings kon nie onderbreek word nie, daarom kan die volgende "
"een die bywerking weer terugbring. As dit gebeur, skakel Outomatiese "
"bywerkings in Wheelhouse af en vertel dit vir u helper."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates pause for 3 days, so the same update doesn't come straight "
"back. They turn back on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Outomatiese bywerkings word vir 3 dae onderbreek, sodat dieselfde bywerking "
"nie dadelik weer kom nie. Hulle skakel vanself weer aan."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates then pause for 3 days, so the bad update doesn't come "
"straight back. If the problem returns after that, turn off Automatic updates "
"in Wheelhouse and tell your helper."
msgstr ""
"Outomatiese bywerkings word dan vir 3 dae onderbreek, sodat die slegte "
"bywerking nie dadelik weer terugkom nie. As die probleem daarna terugkom, "
"skakel Outomatiese bywerkings in Wheelhouse af en vertel dit vir u helper."

