msgid "Nothing has been installed with Install Package File yet."
msgstr "Niks is nog met \"Installeer pakketlêer\" geïnstalleer nie."

msgid "Nothing is shared yet"
msgstr "Niks is nog gedeel nie"

msgid "Nothing matches"
msgstr "Niks stem ooreen nie"

msgid ""
"Nothing more was changed on the disk. Save the log puts the details on a USB "
"stick for your helper; no account is needed. Show a QR code sends a report "
"from your phone, and Report on GitHub sends it from Firefox; both need a free"
" GitHub account. Or click Restart."
msgstr ""
"Niks anders is op die skyf verander nie. Stoor die loglêer sit die "
"besonderhede op 'n USB-stokkie vir u helper; geen rekening is nodig nie. Wys "
"'n QR-kode stuur 'n verslag vanaf u foon, en Rapporteer op GitHub stuur dit "
"vanaf Firefox; albei het 'n gratis GitHub-rekening nodig. Of klik op "
"Herbegin."

msgid "Nothing to change: Zoom meetings open in Chrome, or the first one asks."
msgstr ""
"Niks om te verander nie: Zoom-vergaderings maak oop in Chrome, of die eerste "
"een vra."

msgid "Nothing updates until you run System Update."
msgstr "Niks word bygewerk totdat u Stelselbywerking laat loop nie."

msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Kennisgewings"

msgid "November"
msgstr "November"

msgid "OK"
msgstr "OK"

msgid "October"
msgstr "Oktober"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "Af"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Off here: {name} is {place}."
msgstr "Af hier: {name} is {place}."

msgid "Off unless you need it"
msgstr "Af, tensy u dit nodig het"

msgid "Off. Skip the disk password at startup."
msgstr "Af. Slaan die skyfwagwoord by opstart oor."

msgid "Off. Turn them on or off."
msgstr "Af. Skakel hulle aan of af."

msgid "On Home, use the switch for it above."
msgstr "Op Tuis, gebruik die skakelaar daarvoor hierbo."

msgid "On a Mac: Finder, Network. On another Linux computer: Files, Network."
msgstr ""
"Op 'n Mac: Finder, Netwerk. Op 'n ander Linux-rekenaar: Lêers, Network "
"(Netwerk)."

msgid ""
"On a Public place it asks first, because strangers could reach it too. The "
"bin next to it closes it again."
msgstr ""
"Op 'n Openbare plek vra dit eers, want vreemdelinge kan dit ook bereik. Die "
"asblik langsaan maak dit weer toe."

msgid ""
"On a Windows PC: File Explorer, Network. The Windows PC's own network must be"
" set to Private."
msgstr ""
"Op 'n Windows-rekenaar: Lêerverkenner, Netwerk. Die Windows-rekenaar se eie "
"netwerk moet op Privaat gestel word."

msgid ""
"On top of what the place itself lets in. Each change asks for your password."
msgstr ""
"Bo en behalwe wat die plek self inlaat. Elke verandering vra vir u wagwoord."

msgid "On. Skip the disk password at startup."
msgstr "Aan. Slaan die skyfwagwoord by opstart oor."

msgid "On. Turn them on or off."
msgstr "Aan. Skakel hulle aan of af."

msgid "One file at a time: the first one is opening."
msgstr "Een lêer op 'n slag: die eerste een word oopgemaak."

msgid "Open"
msgstr "Maak oop"

msgid "Open Bazaar"
msgstr "Maak Bazaar oop"

msgid "Open Bazaar, the app store, from the start menu or the dock."
msgstr ""
"Maak Bazaar, die toepassingswinkel, oop vanaf die beginkieslys of die dok."

msgid ""
"Open Files from the start menu or the dock. It opens on your home folder."
msgstr ""
"Maak Lêers oop vanaf die beginkieslys of die dok. Dit maak in u tuisgids oop."

msgid "Open Install Package File"
msgstr "Maak Installeer pakketlêer oop"

msgid "Open Printers"
msgstr "Maak Printers oop"

msgid "Open Settings, Appearance."
msgstr "Maak Instellings oop, dan Appearance (Voorkoms)."

msgid "Open Settings, Apps, Default Apps."
msgstr "Maak Instellings, Apps, Default Apps (verstektoepassings) oop."

msgid "Open Settings, Bluetooth, and turn on the switch at the top."
msgstr ""
"Maak Instellings oop, gaan na Bluetooth, en skakel die skakelaar bo-aan aan."

msgid ""
"Open Settings, Displays, Night Light, and turn it on. It follows sunset and "
"sunrise, or set your own times."
msgstr ""
"Maak Instellings, Displays (Skerms), Naglig oop en skakel dit aan. Dit volg "
"sonsondergang en sonsopkoms, of u kan u eie tye instel."

msgid "Open Settings, Displays."
msgstr "Maak Instellings oop, dan Displays (Skerms)."

msgid "Open Settings, Printers, and click Add Printer."
msgstr ""
"Maak Instellings oop, gaan na Printers (Drukkers) en klik op Add Printer "
"(Voeg drukker by)."

msgid "Open Settings, Sound."
msgstr "Maak Instellings oop, dan Klank."

msgid "Open Settings, System, Users."
msgstr "Maak Instellings, Stelsel, Gebruikers oop."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse"
msgstr "Maak Wheelhouse oop"

msgid "Open Wheelhouse on its Updates page"
msgstr "Maak Wheelhouse oop op sy Bywerkings-bladsy"

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Apps, Get a VPN."
msgstr "Maak Wheelhouse oop, gaan na Toepassings, en kies Kry 'n VPN."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Apps, Media codecs."
msgstr "Maak Wheelhouse, Toepassings, Mediakodeks oop."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Disk and startup, Restart into BIOS settings."
msgstr ""
"Maak Wheelhouse oop, gaan na Skyf en opstart, en kies Herbegin na BIOS-"
"instellings."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Disk and startup, Unlock disk automatically."
msgstr ""
"Maak Wheelhouse oop, gaan na Skyf en opstart, en kies Ontsluit skyf "
"outomaties."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Disk and startup. The bar shows how much is free."
msgstr "Maak Wheelhouse, Skyf en opstart oop. Die balk toon hoeveel vry is."

msgid ""
"Open Wheelhouse, Disk and startup. Under Common fixes, turn on the one that "
"matches the problem."
msgstr ""
"Maak Wheelhouse, Skyf en opstart oop. Onder Algemene oplossings, skakel die "
"een aan wat by die probleem pas."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Get help, Certificate alerts to see them."
msgstr ""
"Maak Wheelhouse oop, gaan na Kry hulp, en dan na Sertifikaatwaarskuwings om "
"dit te sien."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Get help, Save problem details."
msgstr "Maak Wheelhouse oop, Kry hulp, Stoor probleembesonderhede."

msgid ""
"Open Wheelhouse, Get help, Test automatic rollback. Save your work first."
msgstr ""
"Maak Wheelhouse oop, gaan na Kry hulp, en kies Toets outomatiese terugrol. "
"Stoor eers u werk."

msgid ""
"Open Wheelhouse, Get help, and scroll to the end. Every tool has its command "
"there."
msgstr ""
"Maak Wheelhouse oop, gaan na Kry hulp, en blaai tot by die einde. Elke "
"hulpmiddel het sy eie opdrag daar."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Make it yours, Desktop layout."
msgstr "Maak Wheelhouse oop, Maak dit u s'n, Werkskermuitleg."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Make it yours, Fonts and text."
msgstr "Maak Wheelhouse oop, Maak dit u s'n, Lettertipes en teks."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Make it yours, Light and dark."
msgstr "Maak Wheelhouse oop, Maak dit u s'n, Lig en donker."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Make it yours, Wallpaper slideshow, and click Choose."
msgstr ""
"Maak Wheelhouse oop, kies \"Maak dit u s'n\", dan \"Agtergrond-"
"skyfievertoning\", en klik op \"Kies\"."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Make it yours."
msgstr "Maak Wheelhouse oop, Maak dit u s'n."

msgid ""
"Open Wheelhouse, Network safety. Under Also let in, on Home, there are two "
"switches."
msgstr ""
"Maak Wheelhouse oop, Netwerkveiligheid. Onder Laat ook in, op Tuis, is daar "
"twee skakelaars."

msgid ""
"Open Wheelhouse, Network safety. Under Apps and ports let in, pick the place."
msgstr ""
"Maak Wheelhouse oop, Netwerkveiligheid. Kies die plek onder Toepassings en "
"poorte wat ingelaat word."

msgid ""
"Open Wheelhouse, Network safety. Your networks lists every network this "
"computer has joined."
msgstr ""
"Maak Wheelhouse oop, Netwerkveiligheid. U netwerke lys elke netwerk waartoe "
"hierdie rekenaar aangesluit het."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Shared folders."
msgstr "Maak Wheelhouse, Gedeelde gidse oop."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Updates, Automatic updates. On is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Maak Wheelhouse, Bywerkings, Outomatiese bywerkings oop. Aan word aanbeveel."

msgid ""
"Open Wi-Fi, with no password, is always a Public place, because anyone can "
"make one with the same name."
msgstr ""
"Oop Wi-Fi, sonder 'n wagwoord, is altyd 'n Openbare plek, want enigiemand kan"
" een met dieselfde naam maak."

msgid "Open a port"
msgstr "Maak 'n poort oop"

msgid "Open a port on Home"
msgstr "Maak 'n poort oop op Tuis"

msgid "Open a port on Work"
msgstr "Maak 'n poort oop op Werk"

msgid "Open a port on a Public place"
msgstr "Maak 'n poort oop op 'n Openbare plek"

msgid "Open an app"
msgstr "Maak 'n toepassing oop"

msgid "Open it"
msgstr "Maak dit oop"

msgid "Open the computer's BIOS settings screen"
msgstr "Maak die rekenaar se BIOS-instellingsskerm oop"

msgid "Open the computer's own settings screen"
msgstr "Maak die rekenaar se eie instellingsskerm oop"

msgid "Open the file again to install it."
msgstr "Maak die lêer weer oop om dit te installeer."

msgid "Open the file, or drop it on Wheelhouse, Apps."
msgstr "Maak die lêer oop, of sleep dit na Wheelhouse, Toepassings."

msgid "Open the file, or use Install a package file in Wheelhouse, Apps."
msgstr ""
"Maak die lêer oop, of gebruik \"Installeer 'n pakketlêer\" in Wheelhouse, "
"Toepassings."

msgid ""
"Open this computer, type your user name and the sharing password, and the "
"folders are there."
msgstr ""
"Maak hierdie rekenaar oop, tik u gebruikersnaam en die deelwagwoord in, en "
"die gidse is daar."

msgid "Open your folders from another computer at home"
msgstr "Maak u gidse oop vanaf 'n ander rekenaar by die huis"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Open {name}"
msgstr "Maak {name} oop"

msgid ""
"Opens New to EvenKeelOS at login, after the setup checklist, until its Don't "
"show this again box is ticked"
msgstr ""
"Maak Nuut by EvenKeelOS? by aanmelding oop, ná die opstelkontrolelys, totdat "
"sy boksie Moenie dit weer wys nie gemerk is"

msgid "Opens a Zoom meeting in Zoom's web version, in Chrome"
msgstr "Maak 'n Zoom-vergadering oop in Zoom se webweergawe, in Chrome"

msgid "Opens the setup checklist once, the first time a user logs in"
msgstr ""
"Maak die opstelkontrolelys een keer oop, die eerste keer wat 'n gebruiker "
"aanmeld"

msgid "Optional formats left out for legal reasons"
msgstr "Opsionele formate wat om regsredes weggelaat is"

msgid "Optional: add the media codecs that are left out for legal reasons"
msgstr "Opsioneel: voeg die mediakodeks by wat om regsredes weggelaat is"

msgid "Or Cancel."
msgstr "Of Kanselleer."

msgid "Or Keep it."
msgstr "Of Hou dit."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Or Keep it: saves setup time if you'll install another {kind} app soon."
msgstr ""
"Of Hou dit: bespaar opstellingstyd as u binnekort nog 'n {kind}-toepassing "
"gaan installeer."

msgid ""
"Or use the keyboard: Windows key + Up fills the screen, Windows key + Left or"
" Right fills a half, and Windows key + H minimizes."
msgstr ""
"Of gebruik die sleutelbord: Windows-sleutel + Op vul die skerm, Windows-"
"sleutel + Links of Regs vul 'n helfte, en Windows-sleutel + H minimaliseer."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Or {button}: adds a second copy. {note} You would have two of the same app."
msgstr ""
"Of {button}: voeg 'n tweede kopie by. {note} U sou twee van dieselfde "
"toepassing hê."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Other ({zone})"
msgstr "Ander ({zone})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Other computers ask for your user name, {user}, and this password. It isn't "
"your login password."
msgstr ""
"Ander rekenaars vra vir u gebruikersnaam, {user}, en hierdie wagwoord. Dit is"
" nie u aanmeldwagwoord nie."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Other computers ask for your user name, {user}, and this password. Use at "
"least {n} character. Your login password doesn't change."
msgid_plural ""
"Other computers ask for your user name, {user}, and this password. Use at "
"least {n} characters. Your login password doesn't change."
msgstr[0] ""
"Ander rekenaars vra vir u gebruikersnaam, {user}, en hierdie wagwoord. "
"Gebruik ten minste {n} karakter. U aanmeldwagwoord verander nie."
msgstr[1] ""
"Ander rekenaars vra vir u gebruikersnaam, {user}, en hierdie wagwoord. "
"Gebruik ten minste {n} karakters. U aanmeldwagwoord verander nie."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Other computers find this one as {host}: in Files under Network on Linux, in "
"Finder under Network on a Mac, and under Network in File Explorer on Windows."
msgstr ""
"Ander rekenaars vind hierdie een as {host}: in Lêers onder Network (Netwerk) "
"op Linux, in Finder onder Netwerk op 'n Mac, en onder Netwerk in "
"Lêerverkenner op Windows."

msgid ""
"Other computers open these as you, so whatever they save belongs to you."
msgstr ""
"Ander rekenaars maak dit oop as u, so alles wat hulle stoor, behoort aan u."

msgid "Other computers print to a printer plugged into this one"
msgstr ""
"Ander rekenaars druk op 'n drukker wat aan hierdie rekenaar gekoppel is"

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Oorsig"

msgid "Packages (.rpm, .deb)"
msgstr "Pakkette (.rpm, .deb)"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "Wagwoord"

msgid "Paused. Turn them on or off."
msgstr "Onderbreek. Skakel hulle aan of af."

msgid "Pausing automatic updates."
msgstr "Besig om outomatiese bywerkings te onderbreek."

msgid ""
"Phones, file sharing and apps you run can reach this computer. System "
"services stay closed unless switched on below."
msgstr ""
"Fone, lêerdeling en toepassings wat u laat loop, kan hierdie rekenaar bereik."
" Stelseldienste bly gesluit, tensy dit hieronder aangeskakel word."

msgid "Pick Home, Work or Public place for it below."
msgstr "Kies hieronder Tuis, Werk of Openbare plek daarvoor."

msgid ""
"Pick Mullvad, Proton, IVPN or NordVPN. It's added from that company's own "
"download source, and kept up to date."
msgstr ""
"Kies Mullvad, Proton, IVPN of NordVPN. Dit word van daardie maatskappy se eie"
" aflaaibron bygevoeg en word op datum gehou."

msgid ""
"Pick Sunset to sunrise, or Custom times and pick when dark starts and ends."
msgstr ""
"Kies Sonsondergang tot sonsopkoms, of Pasgemaakte tye en kies wanneer die "
"donker begin en eindig."

msgid ""
"Pick Windows-style (a bar at the bottom and a start menu) or Standard (a bar "
"at the top and a dock)."
msgstr ""
"Kies Windows-styl ('n balk onderaan en 'n beginkieslys) of Standaard ('n balk"
" bo-aan en 'n dok)."

msgid "Pick Windows-style or Standard, click Switch, then log out and back in."
msgstr ""
"Kies Windows-styl of Standaard, klik op Skakel oor, en meld dan af en weer "
"aan."

msgid "Pick a Windows program"
msgstr "Kies 'n Windows-program"

msgid "Pick a file"
msgstr "Kies 'n lêer"

msgid "Pick a folder inside your home folder."
msgstr "Kies 'n gids binne u tuisgids."

msgid "Pick a folder of pictures"
msgstr "Kies 'n gids met foto's"

msgid "Pick a folder to share"
msgstr "Kies 'n gids om te deel"

msgid "Pick a folder, not a file."
msgstr "Kies 'n gids, nie 'n lêer nie."

msgid "Pick a problem to test. Your computer should fix it by itself."
msgstr "Kies 'n probleem om te toets. U rekenaar behoort dit self reg te maak."

msgid "Pick a test, click Start the test, and type your password."
msgstr "Kies 'n toets, klik op Begin die toets, en tik u wagwoord in."

msgid "Pick an .exe or .msi to get its Linux version"
msgstr "Kies 'n .exe- of .msi-lêer om die Linux-weergawe daarvan te kry"

msgid "Pick an .rpm or .deb file from Downloads"
msgstr "Kies 'n .rpm- of .deb-lêer uit Aflaaie"

msgid "Pick an app or game so other computers can reach it"
msgstr "Kies 'n toepassing of speletjie sodat ander rekenaars dit kan bereik"

msgid "Pick it again in Get a VPN."
msgstr "Kies dit weer in Kry 'n VPN."

msgid "Pick one."
msgstr "Kies een."

msgid "Pick the app for the web, mail, calendar, music, videos and photos."
msgstr ""
"Kies die toepassing vir die web, e-pos, kalender, musiek, video's en foto's."

msgid ""
"Pick the app. To use it every time for that kind of file, turn on Always use "
"for this file type first."
msgstr ""
"Kies die toepassing. Om dit elke keer vir daardie soort lêer te gebruik, "
"skakel eers \"Always use for this file type\" (gebruik altyd vir hierdie "
"lêertipe) aan."

msgid ""
"Pick the box. It's set up again, with its apps. Your files aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Kies die boks. Dit word weer opgestel, saam met sy toepassings. U lêers word "
"nie geraak nie."

msgid "Pick the day. Back keeps it as it is."
msgstr "Kies die dag. \"Terug\" hou dit soos dit is."

msgid ""
"Pick the folder, then how often it changes: every hour, every day or at each "
"login."
msgstr ""
"Kies die gids, en dan hoe dikwels dit verander: elke uur, elke dag of by elke"
" aanmelding."

msgid "Pick the fonts for menus, documents and code"
msgstr "Kies die lettertipes vir kieslyse, dokumente en kode"

msgid "Pick the hour. Back keeps it as it is."
msgstr "Kies die uur. \"Terug\" hou dit soos dit is."

msgid "Pick the minute. Back keeps it as it is."
msgstr "Kies die minuut. \"Terug\" hou dit soos dit is."

msgid "Pick the month. Back keeps it as it is."
msgstr "Kies die maand. \"Terug\" hou dit soos dit is."

msgid "Pick the place next to a network. It changes at once."
msgstr "Kies die plek langs 'n netwerk. Dit verander dadelik."

msgid ""
"Pick the speakers or headphones under Output Device, and the microphone under"
" Input Device."
msgstr ""
"Kies die luidsprekers of koptelefone onder Output Device (afvoertoestel), en "
"die mikrofoon onder Input Device (toevoertoestel)."

msgid "Pick the year. Back keeps it as it is."
msgstr "Kies die jaar. \"Terug\" hou dit soos dit is."

msgid "Pick what you need. It explains each choice."
msgstr "Kies wat u nodig het. Dit verduidelik elke keuse."

msgid "Pick which ones open when you log in"
msgstr "Kies dié wat oopmaak wanneer u aanmeld"

msgid "Place"
msgstr "Plek"

msgid ""
"Plug in a USB stick, then click it to save the log on it. Click Refresh if it"
" isn't listed, or Back."
msgstr ""
"Steek 'n USB-stokkie in, klik dan daarop om die loglêer daarop te stoor. Klik"
" op Verfris as dit nie gelys is nie, of op Terug."

msgid "Plug in a second USB stick, then click Save the results again."
msgstr "Steek 'n tweede USB-stokkie in, klik dan weer op \"Stoor die resultate\"."

msgid ""
"Plug in a second USB stick, then click it to save the log on it. Or click "
"Back."
msgstr ""
"Steek 'n tweede USB-stokkie in, klik dan daarop om die loglêer daarop te "
"stoor. Of klik op Terug."

msgid "Plug it in. It shows in the left side of Files."
msgstr "Prop dit in. Dit verskyn aan die linkerkant van Lêers."

msgid "Plug the computer in. Open Wheelhouse, Updates, Update firmware."
msgstr ""
"Koppel die rekenaar aan die krag. Maak Wheelhouse oop, gaan na Bywerkings, en"
" kies Werk firmware by."

msgid ""
"Point your phone's camera at the code. It opens the report on GitHub with the"
" details filled in. To send it, sign in to GitHub, or make a free account if "
"you don't have one. It carries the end of the log; the whole log can go on a "
"USB stick. Click Back when done."
msgstr ""
"Rig u foon se kamera op die kode. Dit maak die verslag op GitHub oop met die "
"besonderhede ingevul. Om dit te stuur, meld aan by GitHub, of maak 'n gratis "
"rekening as u nie een het nie. Dit bevat die einde van die loglêer; die hele "
"loglêer kan op 'n USB-stokkie gestoor word. Klik op Terug wanneer u klaar is."

msgid "Port, like 8080, or a range, like 2456-2458"
msgstr "Poort, soos 8080, of 'n reeks, soos 2456-2458"

msgid "Power modes"
msgstr "Kragmodusse"

msgid "Prefer the terminal?"
msgstr "Verkies u die terminaal?"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Preparing the {label}."
msgstr "Besig om die {label} voor te berei."

msgid ""
"Press Print Screen. Pick the whole screen, a window, or drag over an area, "
"then click the round button."
msgstr ""
"Druk Print Screen. Kies die hele skerm, 'n venster, of sleep oor 'n area, en "
"klik dan op die ronde knoppie."

msgid "Printers didn't open. Open Settings, then Printers."
msgstr ""
"Printers (Drukkers) het nie oopgemaak nie. Maak Instellings oop, dan "
"Printers."

msgid ""
"Printers is open. Choose Add Printer.\n"
"\n"
"If your printer isn't there or doesn't print right, open this file again and choose Install the driver."
msgstr ""
"Printers (Drukkers) is oop. Kies Add Printer (Voeg drukker by).\n"
"\n"
"As u drukker nie daar is nie of nie reg druk nie, maak hierdie lêer weer oop en kies Installeer die drywer."

msgid ""
"Printers is open. Choose Add Printer.\n"
"\n"
"If your printer isn't there or doesn't print right, open this file again to see how to get the driver."
msgstr ""
"Printers (Drukkers) is oop. Kies Add Printer (Voeg drukker by).\n"
"\n"
"As u drukker nie daar is nie of nie reg druk nie, maak hierdie lêer weer oop om te sien hoe u die drywer kan kry."

msgid "Printing"
msgstr "Drukwerk"

msgid "Printing doesn't start"
msgstr "Drukwerk begin nie"

msgid "Printing service off"
msgstr "Drukdiens af"

msgid "Problem"
msgstr "Probleem"

msgid "Protocol"
msgstr "Protokol"

msgid "Public place"
msgstr "Openbare plek"

msgid ""
"Public place: nothing on the network can reach your computer. Pick it for "
"cafes, hotels and airports."
msgstr ""
"Openbare plek: niks op die netwerk kan u rekenaar bereik nie. Kies dit vir "
"kafees, hotelle en lughawens."

msgid "Put EvenKeelOS on this computer"
msgstr "Sit EvenKeelOS op hierdie rekenaar"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Put back: {apps}."
msgstr "Sit terug: {apps}."

msgid ""
"Put the device in pairing mode. Its instructions say how, often by holding "
"its power button."
msgstr ""
"Sit die toestel in paringsmodus. Die instruksies sê hoe, dikwels deur sy "
"aan/af-knoppie in te hou."

msgid "Put the pictures in one folder, for example in Pictures."
msgstr "Sit die prente in een gids, byvoorbeeld in Prente."

msgid "Quick fixes"
msgstr "Vinnige oplossings"

msgid "Quick test"
msgstr "Vinnige toets"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Quit {app}"
msgstr "Verlaat {app}"

msgid "Quitting %s"
msgstr "Besig om %s te sluit"

msgid "Read and write"
msgstr "Lees en skryf"

msgid "Read only"
msgstr "Lees-alleen"

msgid "Reading the disk"
msgstr "Besig om die skyf te lees"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Reading the download source {name}"
msgstr "Besig om die aflaaibron {name} te lees"

msgid "Reading the list of apps from the new download source"
msgstr "Besig om die lys van toepassings vanaf die nuwe aflaaibron te lees"

msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Aanbeveel"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Recommended: Delete the box. It frees about {size}, and comes back by itself "
"the next time you install {apps}. Anything added to the box another way is "
"deleted too. Your files are not touched."
msgstr ""
"Aanbeveel: Verwyder die boks. Dit maak sowat {size} vry, en kom vanself terug"
" die volgende keer as u {apps} installeer. Enigiets wat op 'n ander manier by"
" die boks gevoeg is, word ook verwyder. U lêers word nie geraak nie."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Recommended: Delete the box. It frees its disk space, and comes back by "
"itself the next time you install {apps}. Anything added to the box another "
"way is deleted too. Your files are not touched."
msgstr ""
