"ander een."

msgid "That isn't let in here."
msgstr "Dit word nie hier ingelaat nie."

msgid "That isn't the disk password, so nothing was changed. Try again."
msgstr ""
"Dit is nie die skyfwagwoord nie, daarom is niks verander nie. Probeer weer."

msgid ""
"That was the wrong disk password too many times, so it's locked for an hour. "
"Nothing was changed. Try again after that."
msgstr ""
"Die verkeerde skyfwagwoord is te veel keer ingevoer, daarom is dit vir 'n uur"
" gesluit. Niks is verander nie. Probeer daarna weer."

msgid ""
"The BIOS screen uses the keyboard. When you're done, choose Save and Exit, or"
" Exit."
msgstr ""
"Die BIOS-skerm gebruik die sleutelbord. Wanneer u klaar is, kies Save and "
"Exit, of Exit."

msgid ""
"The BIOS's RAID setting (Intel RST) hides the disk. Restart into the BIOS and"
" set the storage mode (often called SATA mode or SATA operation) to AHCI. "
"Windows on this disk won't start after that change, but installing EvenKeelOS"
" erases it anyway."
msgstr ""
"Die BIOS se RAID-instelling (Intel RST) verberg die skyf. Herbegin na die "
"BIOS en stel die bergingmodus (dikwels SATA-modus of SATA-werking genoem) op "
"AHCI. Windows op hierdie skyf sal nie ná daardie verandering begin nie, maar "
"die installering van EvenKeelOS vee dit in elk geval uit."

msgid "The Bluetooth driver is blocked, so there's no Bluetooth."
msgstr "Die Bluetooth-drywer is geblokkeer, daarom is daar geen Bluetooth nie."

msgid ""
"The NVIDIA card runs on the open-source driver built into EvenKeelOS. The "
"proprietary NVIDIA driver isn't used: it breaks too often to keep the promise"
" that EvenKeelOS just works. If you need it, use Bazzite or Bluefin's NVIDIA "
"editions instead."
msgstr ""
"Die NVIDIA-kaart gebruik die oopbron-drywer wat in EvenKeelOS ingebou is. Die"
" geslote NVIDIA-drywer word nie gebruik nie: dit breek te dikwels om die "
"belofte te hou dat EvenKeelOS eenvoudig werk. As u dit nodig het, gebruik "
"eerder Bazzite of Bluefin se NVIDIA-uitgawes."

msgid "The QR code could not be made. Save the log to a stick instead."
msgstr ""
"Die QR-kode kon nie gemaak word nie. Gebruik eerder Stoor die loglêer om dit "
"op 'n stokkie te stoor."

msgid "The USB stick could not be opened."
msgstr "Die USB-stokkie kon nie oopgemaak word nie."

msgid "The VPN list is missing."
msgstr "Die VPN-lys ontbreek."

msgid "The Wi-Fi card's driver is blocked, so there's no Wi-Fi."
msgstr ""
"Die Wi-Fi-kaart se drywer is geblokkeer, daarom is daar geen Wi-Fi nie."

msgid "The administrator password was not given, so nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Die administrateurwagwoord is nie gegee nie, daarom is niks verander nie."

msgid "The administrator password wasn't given, so nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Die administrateurwagwoord is nie gegee nie, daarom is niks verander nie."

msgid "The app system (Flatpak)"
msgstr "Die toepassingstelsel (Flatpak)"

msgid "The app's instructions say TCP, UDP or both"
msgstr "Die toepassing se instruksies sê TCP, UDP of albei"

msgid "The automatic rollback test worked."
msgstr "Die outomatiese terugroltoets het gewerk."

msgid ""
"The automatic update is already running, so this window follows it until it's"
" done. You can keep working."
msgstr ""
"Die outomatiese bywerking loop reeds, so hierdie venster volg dit totdat dit "
"klaar is. U kan aanhou werk."

msgid ""
"The battery is at %s%% and the computer isn't plugged in. If the battery runs"
" out during the update, the update is lost and has to start "
"again.\\n\\nRecommended: Not now. Plug the computer in, then start System "
"Update again.\\n\\nOr Update anyway."
msgstr ""
"Die battery is op %s%% en die rekenaar is nie ingeprop nie. As die battery "
"tydens die bywerking leeg raak, gaan die bywerking verlore en moet dit weer "
"begin.\\n\\nAanbeveel: Nie nou nie. Prop die rekenaar in, en begin dan "
"Stelselbywerking weer.\\n\\nOf Werk tog by."

msgid ""
"The battery is at %s%%. Plug the computer in: if it runs out during the "
"update, the update is lost."
msgstr ""
"Die battery is op %s%%. Prop die rekenaar in: as die battery tydens die "
"bywerking leeg raak, gaan die bywerking verlore."

#, python-brace-format
