msgstr ""
"Die rekenaar het nie behoorlik begin met die opstartopsies wat in Wheelhouse "
"verander is nie, daarom het dit teruggegaan na die weergawe van {since}, met "
"die opstartopsies wat dit voorheen gehad het."

msgid ""
"The computer hasn't saved a copy of its settings since this start yet. Wait a"
" few minutes and try again. If it keeps saying this, tell your helper: the "
"copy isn't being saved."
msgstr ""
"Die rekenaar het nog nie sedert hierdie opstart 'n kopie van sy instellings "
"gestoor nie. Wag 'n paar minute en probeer weer. As dit aanhou om dit te sê, "
"vertel dit vir u helper: die kopie word nie gestoor nie."

msgid "The computer locks up"
msgstr "Die rekenaar vries"

msgid ""
"The computer may not start, or may lose its drive, memory or processors."
msgstr ""
"Die rekenaar begin dalk nie, of dit kan sy skyf, geheue of verwerkers "
"verloor."

msgid ""
"The computer restarts and opens its BIOS settings screen. Save your work first.\n"
"\n"
"The BIOS settings are used with the keyboard. When you're done, choose Save and Exit, or Exit, to start the computer again."
msgstr ""
"Die rekenaar herbegin en maak sy BIOS-instellingsskerm oop. Stoor eers u werk.\n"
"\n"
"Die BIOS-instellings word met die sleutelbord gebruik. Wanneer u klaar is, kies Save and Exit, of Exit, om die rekenaar weer te begin."

msgid ""
"The computer restarts, fails on purpose, then goes back by itself. A note at "
