msgid "The firewall isn't answering"
msgstr "Die vuurmuur antwoord nie"

msgid "The firmware update didn't finish. Try again later."
msgstr "Die firmware-bywerking is nie voltooi nie. Probeer later weer."

msgid "The firmware updater"
msgstr "Die firmware-bywerker"

msgid ""
"The first meeting asks whether to install Chrome or use your usual browser."
msgstr ""
"Die eerste vergadering vra of u Chrome wil installeer of u gewone blaaier wil"
