msgstr ""
"Kies die eerste keer Installeer Chrome of Gebruik die gewone blaaier. Die "
"vergadering maak in Zoom se webweergawe oop."

msgid "The full codecs are already installed. Restart if you have not yet."
msgstr ""
"Die volledige kodeks is reeds geïnstalleer. Herbegin as u dit nog nie gedoen "
"het nie."

msgid "The full guide"
msgstr "Die volledige gids"

msgid "The full name is empty."
msgstr "Die volle naam is leeg."

msgid ""
"The graphics driver is blocked, so the screen runs in a basic mode: it may "
"look blurry or slow, or stay black (then just wait)."
msgstr ""
"Die grafiese drywer is geblokkeer, daarom werk die skerm in 'n basiese modus:"
" dit kan vaag of stadig lyk, of swart bly (wag dan net)."

msgid "The install could not be finished."
msgstr "Die installasie kon nie voltooi word nie."

