msgstr "Die installeerder het onverwags gestop."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The keyboard ({device})"
msgstr "Die sleutelbord ({device})"

msgid "The last lines of the log:"
msgstr "Die laaste reëls van die loglêer:"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The last start failed its start-up checks, and some system settings were missing or replaced. Your computer put back {n} from the copy it saved {saved}, then restarted. Your files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"If it happens again, tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgid_plural ""
"The last start failed its start-up checks, and some system settings were missing or replaced. Your computer put back {n} from the copy it saved {saved}, then restarted. Your files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"If it happens again, tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgstr[0] ""
"Die laaste opstart het nie sy opstartkontroles geslaag nie, en sommige stelselinstellings het ontbreek of is vervang. U rekenaar het {n} teruggesit vanaf die kopie wat dit {saved} gestoor het, en toe herbegin. U lêers en toepassings word nie geraak nie.\n"
"\n"
"Teruggesit: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"As dit weer gebeur, vertel dit vir u helper. Stoor probleembesonderhede in Wheelhouse maak 'n lêer om aan hulle te stuur."
msgstr[1] ""
"Die laaste opstart het nie sy opstartkontroles geslaag nie, en sommige stelselinstellings het ontbreek of is vervang. U rekenaar het {n} teruggesit vanaf die kopie wat dit {saved} gestoor het, en toe herbegin. U lêers en toepassings word nie geraak nie.\n"
"\n"
"Teruggesit: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"As dit weer gebeur, vertel dit vir u helper. Stoor probleembesonderhede in Wheelhouse maak 'n lêer om aan hulle te stuur."

msgid "The layout didn't change."
msgstr "Die uitleg het nie verander nie."

msgid ""
"The layout, colors, wallpaper, dark at night, fonts, screen size, night "
"light, sound and accounts"
msgstr ""
"Die uitleg, kleure, agtergrond, donker in die nag, lettertipes, skermgrootte,"
" naglig, klank en rekeninge"

msgid "The login screen doesn't start"
msgstr "Die aanmeldskerm begin nie"

msgid ""
"The login screen fails to start, so you never see it. The computer restarts "
"by itself within seconds, twice, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Die aanmeldskerm kan nie begin nie, daarom sien u dit nooit nie. Die rekenaar"
" herbegin binne sekondes vanself, twee keer, en die derde opstart is weer op "
"hierdie weergawe."

msgid ""
"The login screen works, but logging in drops you back to it. Log in a second "
"time; after the second drop the computer restarts by itself. Do that on 2 "
"starts, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Die aanmeldskerm werk, maar aanmelding stuur u terug daarheen. Meld 'n tweede"
" keer aan; ná die tweede keer herbegin die rekenaar vanself. Doen dit by 2 "
"opstarte, en die derde opstart is weer op hierdie weergawe."

msgid "The media codecs start working after a restart."
msgstr "Die mediakodeks begin werk nadat u die rekenaar herbegin het."

msgid ""
"The menu that opens has Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, the sound volume, the screen "
"brightness, the power mode, dark style and night light."
msgstr ""
"Die kieslys wat oopmaak het Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, die klankvolume, die "
"skermhelderheid, die kragmodus, donkerstyl en naglig."

msgid "The new files could not be labelled."
msgstr "Die nuwe lêers kon nie geëtiketteer word nie."

msgid "The new partitions did not show up."
msgstr "Die nuwe partisies het nie verskyn nie."

msgid "The new system could not be set to take signed updates."
msgstr ""
"Die nuwe stelsel kon nie ingestel word om ondertekende bywerkings te aanvaar "
"nie."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The new system has no {name} group."
msgstr "Die nuwe stelsel het geen {name}-groep nie."

msgid "The new system's desktop layouts could not be found."
msgstr "Die nuwe stelsel se werkskermuitlegte kon nie gevind word nie."

msgid "The new system's settings database could not be found."
msgstr "Die nuwe stelsel se instellingsdatabasis kon nie gevind word nie."

msgid "The next network you join starts as a Public place."
msgstr "Die volgende netwerk waartoe u aansluit, begin as 'n Openbare plek."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The next start uses: {settings}"
msgstr "Die volgende opstart gebruik: {settings}"

msgid "The one-time setup window is already closed."
msgstr "Die eenmalige opstelvenster is reeds toe."

msgid "The password is typed and matches."
msgstr "Die wagwoord is ingetik en stem ooreen."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The password wasn't saved: {reason}"
msgstr "Die wagwoord is nie gestoor nie: {reason}"

msgid ""
"The picture is copied, ready to paste, and saved in Pictures, Screenshots."
msgstr ""
"Die prent is gekopieer, gereed om te plak, en gestoor in Prente, Screenshots."

msgid ""
"The power button in that menu has Suspend, Restart, Power Off and Log Out."
msgstr ""
"Die aan/af-knoppie in daardie kieslys het Sluimer, Restart (Herbegin), Power "
"Off (Skakel af) en Log Out (Meld af)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The printer driver {title} is ready."
msgstr "Die drukkerdrywer {title} is gereed."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The printer driver {title} is ready.\n"
"\n"
"Open Printers: choose Add Printer, then your printer."
msgstr ""
"Die drukkerdrywer {title} is gereed.\n"
"\n"
"Maak Printers oop: kies Add Printer (Voeg drukker by), en kies dan u drukker."

msgid "The printing service fails to start."
msgstr "Die drukdiens kan nie begin nie."

msgid "The restart didn't start"
msgstr "Die herbegin het nie begin nie"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The restart said:\n"
"\n"
"{message}\n"
"\n"
"Exit code: {code}"
msgstr ""
"Die herbegin het gesê:\n"
"\n"
"{message}\n"
"\n"
"Uittreekode: {code}"

msgid ""
"The root account is the system's own administrator. Most people never need "
"it: your own account can be an administrator instead."
msgstr ""
"Die wortelrekening (root) is die stelsel se eie administrateur. Die meeste "
"mense het dit nooit nodig nie: u eie rekening kan eerder 'n administrateur "
"wees."

msgid "The root password could not be set."
msgstr "Die wortelwagwoord kon nie ingestel word nie."

msgid "The screen flashes white, often with an outside display"
msgstr "Die skerm flits wit, dikwels met 'n eksterne skerm"

msgid ""
"The settings are deleted, but the computer didn't restart. Restart it now: "
"the next start puts them back."
msgstr ""
"Die instellings is uitgevee, maar die rekenaar het nie herbegin nie. Herbegin"
" dit nou: die volgende opstart sit hulle terug."

msgid "The settings repair test didn't work."
msgstr "Die toets om die instellings te herstel het nie gewerk nie."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The settings repair test didn't work: your computer couldn't put the deleted settings back, so it went back to the version from {since}, which has its own settings. Your files and apps aren't touched, and automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgstr ""
"Die toets om instellings te herstel het nie gewerk nie: u rekenaar kon nie die verwyderde instellings terugsit nie, daarom het dit teruggegaan na die weergawe van {since}, wat sy eie instellings het. U lêers en toepassings word nie geraak nie, en outomatiese bywerkings word nie onderbreek nie.\n"
"\n"
"Vertel dit vir u helper. Stoor probleembesonderhede in Wheelhouse maak 'n lêer om aan hulle te stuur."

msgid "The settings repair test worked."
msgstr "Die toets om instellings te herstel het gewerk."

msgid "The sound chip's driver is blocked, so there's no sound."
msgstr ""
"Die klankskyfie se drywer is geblokkeer, daarom is daar geen klank nie."

msgid ""
"The start menu, windows, the menu at the end of the bar, notifications, "
"screenshots and shortcuts"
msgstr ""
"Die beginkieslys, vensters, die kieslys aan die einde van die balk, "
"kennisgewings, skermskote en kortpaaie"

msgid "The sun doesn't set or rise here today, so it's dark until it rises."
msgstr ""
"Die son gaan vandag hier nie onder of op nie, so dit is donker totdat dit "
"opkom."

msgid "The sun doesn't set or rise here today, so it's light until it sets."
msgstr ""
"Die son gaan vandag hier nie onder of op nie, so dit is lig totdat dit "
"ondergaan."

msgid "The system core crashed (a protection fault)"
msgstr "Die stelselkern het omgeval ('n beskermingsfout)"

msgid "The system core crashed (an oops)"
msgstr "Die stelselkern het omgeval ('n oops)"

msgid "The system core reported a bug"
msgstr "Die stelselkern het 'n fout aangemeld"

msgid ""
"The system itself can't be changed by apps or by mistake. Each update "
"replaces it whole."
msgstr ""
"Die stelsel self kan nie deur toepassings of per ongeluk verander word nie. "
"Elke bywerking vervang dit heeltemal."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The test copy ({name}) is ready. It starts at your next restart."
msgstr "Die toetskopie ({name}) is gereed. Dit begin by u volgende herbegin."

msgid ""
"The test marker is removed. The version without it starts at your next "
"restart."
msgstr ""
"Die toetsmerker is verwyder. Die weergawe sonder dit begin by u volgende "
"herbegin."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The test worked. At the next start your computer found important settings missing, put back {n} setting from the copy it saved {saved}, and restarted by itself.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}."
msgid_plural ""
"The test worked. At the next start your computer found important settings missing, put back {n} settings from the copy it saved {saved}, and restarted by itself.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}."
msgstr[0] ""
"Die toets het gewerk. By die volgende opstart het u rekenaar gevind dat belangrike instellings ontbreek, {n} instelling vanaf die kopie wat dit {saved} gestoor het, teruggesit, en vanself herbegin.\n"
"\n"
"Teruggesit: {what}."
msgstr[1] ""
"Die toets het gewerk. By die volgende opstart het u rekenaar gevind dat belangrike instellings ontbreek, {n} instellings vanaf die kopie wat dit {saved} gestoor het, teruggesit, en vanself herbegin.\n"
"\n"
"Teruggesit: {what}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The test worked. Your computer went back by itself to the version from "
"{since}, and the test copy is removed."
msgstr ""
"Die toets het gewerk. U rekenaar het vanself teruggegaan na die weergawe van "
"{since}, en die toetskopie is verwyder."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The touchpad ({device})"
msgstr "Die raakblad ({device})"

msgid "The two don't match yet."
msgstr "Die twee stem nog nie ooreen nie."

msgid "The update did not finish. Details: journalctl -u %s"
msgstr "Die bywerking het nie voltooi nie. Besonderhede: journalctl -u %s"

msgid "The update didn't finish."
msgstr "Die bywerking is nie voltooi nie."

msgid ""
"The update didn't finish. Nothing is broken: your computer keeps running the "
"version it has.\\n\\nTry again later."
msgstr ""
"Die bywerking is nie voltooi nie. Niks is stukkend nie: u rekenaar gebruik "
"steeds die weergawe wat dit het.\\n\\nProbeer later weer."

msgid "The update program"
msgstr "Die bywerkingsprogram"

msgid ""
"The update program is swapped for one that always fails (until the next "
"restart; nothing on the disk changes)."
msgstr ""
"Die bywerkingsprogram word vervang met een wat altyd misluk (tot die volgende"
" herbegin; niks op die skyf verander nie)."

msgid "The user name is empty."
msgstr "Die gebruikersnaam is leeg."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The version you're using now is from {current}. The one from before it, from {older}, is still on this computer.\n"
"\n"
"If something stopped working after the last update: Undo the update. The version from {older} starts at your next restart. Your files and your apps aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Die weergawe wat u nou gebruik, is van {current}. Die een van voor dit, van {older}, is nog steeds op hierdie rekenaar.\n"
"\n"
"As iets ná die laaste bywerking opgehou het om te werk: Maak die bywerking ongedaan. Die weergawe van {older} begin by u volgende herbegin. U lêers en u toepassings word nie geraak nie."

msgid ""
"The version you're using now is the one before it with boot options changed in Wheelhouse.\n"
"\n"
"Undo the change: the computer starts with the boot options it had before, at your next restart. Automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Or Cancel."
msgstr ""
"Die weergawe wat u nou gebruik, is die een van voorheen, met opstartopsies wat in Wheelhouse verander is.\n"
"\n"
"Maak die verandering ongedaan: die rekenaar begin by u volgende herbegin met die opstartopsies wat dit voorheen gehad het. Outomatiese bywerkings word nie onderbreek nie.\n"
"\n"
"Of Kanselleer."

msgid "The wallpaper changes to the next picture in a folder of yours."
msgstr "Die agtergrond verander na die volgende prent in een van u gidse."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The {fs} file system could not be loaded, so the disk can't be prepared."
msgstr ""
"Die {fs}-lêerstelsel kon nie gelaai word nie, daarom kan die skyf nie "
"voorberei word nie."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is deleted."
msgstr "Die {label} is verwyder."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is not working."
msgstr "Die {label} werk nie."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is repaired."
msgstr "Die {label} is herstel."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The {label} isn't working.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Repair the box. It rebuilds the box, puts your apps back, then installs {title}. Your files aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Die {label} werk nie.\n"
"\n"
"Aanbeveel: Herstel die boks. Dit bou die boks weer op, sit u toepassings terug en installeer dan {title}. U lêers word nie geraak nie."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} ({unit})"
msgstr "Die {name} ({unit})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} graphics drive the screen."
msgstr "Die {name}-grafika bestuur die skerm."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} service ({unit})"
msgstr "Die {name}-diens ({unit})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {title} download isn't signed by ArtCraft, so it was not installed."
msgstr ""
"Die {title}-aflaai is nie deur ArtCraft onderteken nie, daarom is dit nie "
"geïnstalleer nie."

msgid "There are no app boxes to repair."
msgstr "Daar is geen toepassingsbokse om te herstel nie."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "There is no start-up keyboard layout for {layout}."
msgstr "Daar is geen opstart-sleutelborduitleg vir {layout} nie."

msgid ""
"There's no earlier version on this computer to go back to. Only the version "
"you're using now is kept."
msgstr ""
"Daar is geen vroeëre weergawe op hierdie rekenaar waarna u kan teruggaan nie."
" Slegs die weergawe wat u nou gebruik, word behou."

msgid ""
"There's no earlier version to fall back to if putting the settings back "
"doesn't work, so the test doesn't run. Try it after the next update."
msgstr ""
"Daar is geen vroeëre weergawe om na terug te val as die herstel van die "
"instellings nie werk nie, daarom word die toets nie uitgevoer nie. Probeer "
"dit ná die volgende bywerking."

msgid "These security certificates need attention. Pick one to see what to do."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie sekuriteitsertifikate benodig aandag. Kies een om te sien wat om te "
"doen."

msgid "They open in Chrome."
msgstr "Hulle maak oop in Chrome."

msgid "They open in your usual browser. Choose to be asked about Chrome again."
msgstr ""
"Hulle maak oop in u gewone blaaier. Kies om weer gevra te word oor Chrome."

msgid "This account can't share folders."
msgstr "Hierdie rekening kan nie gidse deel nie."

msgid ""
"This computer asks for the disk password every time it starts. The computer's security chip can unlock the disk instead.\n"
"\n"
"This needs the disk password, so it's one for your helper.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Set it up. Or Skip: it's in Wheelhouse any time."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie rekenaar vra elke keer as dit begin vir die skyfwagwoord. Die rekenaar se sekuriteitskyfie kan eerder die skyf ontsluit.\n"
"\n"
"Dit benodig die skyfwagwoord, so dit is een vir u helper.\n"
"\n"
"Aanbeveel: Stel dit op. Of Slaan oor: dit is enige tyd in Wheelhouse."

msgid ""
"This computer can't go back by itself: it was installed before automatic "
"rollback was added, or automatic rollback was switched off. Computers "
"installed from a newer USB have it."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie rekenaar kan nie vanself teruggaan nie: dit is geïnstalleer voordat "
"outomatiese terugrol bygevoeg is, of outomatiese terugrol is afgeskakel. "
"Rekenaars wat vanaf 'n nuwer USB geïnstalleer is, het dit."

msgid ""
"This computer can't open its BIOS settings from here. Press the BIOS key "
"while it starts (often F2, F10, F12 or Delete)."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie rekenaar kan nie sy BIOS-instellings van hier af oopmaak nie. Druk "
"die BIOS-sleutel terwyl dit begin (dikwels F2, F10, F12 of Delete)."

msgid ""
"This computer has no security chip (TPM) that can do this, so the disk "
"password stays."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie rekenaar het nie 'n sekuriteitskyfie (TPM) wat dit kan doen nie, "
"daarom bly die skyfwagwoord."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This computer is running a test copy ({name}) as its normal version, so a new test can't start from it.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Remove the test marker. The version without it starts at your next restart. Needs your password."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie rekenaar gebruik 'n toetskopie ({name}) as sy normale weergawe, daarom kan 'n nuwe toets nie van hier af begin nie.\n"
"\n"
"Aanbeveel: Verwyder die toetsmerker. Die weergawe sonder dit begin by u volgende herbegin. Dit benodig u wagwoord."

msgid ""
"This computer is running a test copy. Open Test automatic rollback again to "
"remove its marker."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie rekenaar gebruik 'n toetskopie. Maak \"Toets outomatiese terugrol\" "
"weer oop om die merker te verwyder."

msgid "This computer started the USB stick in old BIOS (legacy) mode."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie rekenaar het die USB-stokkie in die ou BIOS-modus (legacy) begin."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This desktop uses {now}.\n"
"\n"
"Switch to {new}? It takes effect after you log out and back in.\n"
"\n"
"Or Keep it."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie werkskerm gebruik {now}.\n"
"\n"
"Skakel oor na {new}? Dit tree in werking nadat u afgemeld en weer aangemeld het.\n"
"\n"
"Of Hou dit."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This file can't be installed. It may be damaged or not fully downloaded. Download it again and retry.\n"
"\n"
"(Details: {details})"
msgstr ""
"Hierdie lêer kan nie geïnstalleer word nie. Dit is moontlik beskadig of nie volledig afgelaai nie. Laai dit weer af en probeer weer.\n"
"\n"
"(Besonderhede: {details})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This file is an older version of {title} than the one you have.\n"
"\n"
"Install the older version: replaces yours. Only do this if the newer one has a problem."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie lêer is 'n ouer weergawe van {title} as die een wat u het.\n"
"\n"
"Installeer die ouer weergawe: dit vervang u s'n. Doen dit slegs as daar 'n probleem met die nuwer een is."

msgid ""
"This is a live session: it runs from the USB stick, nothing here is saved, "
"and the computer's disk isn't touched."
msgstr ""
"Dit is 'n live-sessie: dit loop vanaf die USB-stokkie, niks hier word gestoor"
" nie, en die rekenaar se skyf word nie geraak nie."

msgid ""
"This is how the computer shows up on your network. Keep the suggestion, or "
"type a new one."
msgstr ""
"So verskyn die rekenaar op u netwerk. Hou die voorstel, of tik 'n nuwe een "
"in."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This is the 32-bit version of {title}, for older computers. Download the "
"64-bit version instead (often called amd64 or x86_64)."
msgstr ""
"Dit is die 32-bis-weergawe van {title}, vir ouer rekenaars. Laai eerder die "
"64-bis-weergawe af (dikwels amd64 of x86_64 genoem)."

msgid "This network"
msgstr "Hierdie netwerk"

msgid ""
"This removes things the computer no longer needs: unused app parts, old "
"system update files, and unused container images. Your files and your apps "
"aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Dit verwyder dinge wat die rekenaar nie meer nodig het nie: ongebruikte "
"toepassingsonderdele, ou stelselbywerkingslêers en ongebruikte houerbeelde. U"
" lêers en u toepassings word nie geraak nie."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This saves the computer's recent error messages, its system version and the list of your apps to one file, {name}, in your Documents folder. What your apps showed or opened isn't in it.\n"
"\n"
"Then email that file to your helper. They can see what went wrong without being here.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing is sent anywhere by itself."
msgstr ""
"Dit stoor die rekenaar se onlangse foutboodskappe, sy stelselweergawe en die lys van u toepassings in een lêer, {name}, in u Dokumente-gids. Wat u toepassings gewys of oopgemaak het, is nie daarin nie.\n"
"\n"
"Stuur dan daardie lêer per e-pos aan u helper. Hulle kan sien wat skeef geloop het sonder om hier te wees.\n"
"\n"
"Niks word vanself êrens heen gestuur nie."

msgid ""
"This sets what other devices on this network can reach. Pick Public place "
"anywhere you're not sure. You can change it later in Wheelhouse, Network "
"safety."
msgstr ""
"Dit bepaal wat ander toestelle op hierdie netwerk kan bereik. Kies Openbare "
"plek oral waar u nie seker is nie. U kan dit later in Wheelhouse, "
"Netwerkveiligheid verander."

msgid ""
"This sets what you see at first. The next step suggests a desktop layout to "
"match, and the guide is in Wheelhouse, Get help, either way."
msgstr ""
"Dit bepaal wat u aanvanklik sien. Die volgende stap stel 'n bypassende "
"werkskermuitleg voor, en die gids is in elk geval in Wheelhouse, Kry hulp."

msgid "This setting is risky"
msgstr "Hierdie instelling is riskant"

msgid "This start found these broken, as the test expects:"
msgstr ""
"Hierdie opstart het gevind dat hierdie dinge stukkend is, soos die toets "
"verwag:"

msgid "This start found these still broken, as the test expects:"
msgstr ""
"Hierdie opstart het gevind dat hierdie steeds stukkend is, soos die toets "
"verwag:"

msgid "This system's EFI partition: %s (disk %s, partition %s)"
msgstr "Hierdie stelsel se EFI-partisie: %s (skyf %s, partisie %s)"

msgid "This takes a while."
msgstr "Dit neem 'n rukkie."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "This version is from {when}."
msgstr "Hierdie weergawe is van {when}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This {title} file is for a different kind of computer. Download the version "
"for this one (often called {names})."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie {title}-lêer is vir 'n ander soort rekenaar. Laai die weergawe vir "
"hierdie een af (dikwels {names} genoem)."

msgid ""
"Those are file sharing ports: folders are shared only on Home networks, in "
"Shared folders."
msgstr ""
"Dit is lêerdelingpoorte: gidse word slegs op Tuis-netwerke gedeel, in "
"Gedeelde gidse."

msgid "Thunderbolt or USB4 ports"
msgstr "Thunderbolt- of USB4-poorte"

msgid "Time server name"
msgstr "Naam van tydbediener"

msgid "Time servers"
msgstr "Tydbedieners"

msgid ""
"Time servers to use instead of Fedora's. Type a name and click Add. Click a "
"server to take it off. Click Back when done."
msgstr ""
"Tydbedieners om in plaas van dié van Fedora te gebruik. Tik 'n naam in en "
"klik op Voeg by. Klik op 'n bediener om dit te verwyder. Klik op Terug "
"wanneer u klaar is."

msgid "Time zone"
msgstr "Tydsone"

msgid "To be asked again: Wheelhouse, Apps, Zoom meetings."
msgstr "Om weer gevra te word: Wheelhouse, Toepassings, Zoom-vergaderings."

msgid "To change your password, click Password."
msgstr "Om u wagwoord te verander, klik op Wagwoord."

msgid "To check that this works on your computer, see Getting help."
msgstr "Om te kyk of dit op u rekenaar werk, sien Hulp kry."

msgid "To choose which apps can notify you: Settings, Notifications."
msgstr ""
"Om te kies watter toepassings vir u kennisgewings kan stuur: Instellings, "
"Notifications (Kennisgewings)."

msgid "To free the space for good: open Trash and click Empty."
msgstr ""
"Om die spasie permanent vry te maak: maak die Asblik oop en klik op Maak "
"leeg."

msgid ""
"To get it back: open Trash in the left side of Files, right-click the file, "
"and choose Restore From Trash."
msgstr ""
"Om dit terug te kry: maak die Asblik aan die linkerkant van Lêers oop, "
"regsklik op die lêer, en kies Herstel vanuit asblik."

msgid ""
"To give someone their own account, click Add User. Leave Administrator off "
"for children and guests."
msgstr ""
"Om vir iemand hul eie rekening te gee, klik op Voeg gebruiker by. Skakel "
"Administrateur af vir kinders en gaste."

msgid "To go on, click Erase and install. To pick another disk, click Back."
msgstr ""
"Om voort te gaan, klik op Vee uit en installeer. Om 'n ander skyf te kies, "
"klik op Terug."

msgid ""
"To make one: select the files, right-click, choose Compress, give it a name, "
"and click Create."
msgstr ""
"Om een te maak: kies die lêers, regsklik, kies Pers saam, gee dit 'n naam, en"
" klik op Skep."

msgid ""
"To open one: right-click it and choose Extract. The files go in a folder next"
" to it."
msgstr ""
"Om een oop te maak: regsklik daarop en kies Extract (pak uit). Die lêers gaan"
" in 'n gids langsaan."

msgid "To print, press Ctrl+P in any app."
msgstr "Om te druk, druk Ctrl+P in enige toepassing."

msgid ""
"To record a video instead, click the video camera icon in the same tool "
"before you start. Recordings go to Videos, Screencasts."
msgstr ""
"Om eerder 'n video op te neem, klik op die videokamera-ikoon in dieselfde "
"hulpmiddel voordat u begin. Opnames gaan na Video's, Screencasts."

msgid "To update now: open Wheelhouse, Updates, System Update."
msgstr "Om nou by te werk: maak Wheelhouse, Bywerkings, Stelselbywerking oop."

msgid ""
"Told to add a setting by a helper? Type it under Your own settings. Risky "
"ones are explained first."
msgstr ""
"Het 'n helper u gesê om 'n instelling by te voeg? Tik dit in onder U eie "
"instellings. Die riskante word eers verduidelik."

msgid "Too weak"
msgstr "Te swak"

msgid "Tool"
msgstr "Hulpmiddel"

msgid "Top bar, apps from the bottom dock"
msgstr "Boonste balk, toepassings vanaf die onderste dok"

msgid "Touchpad"
msgstr "Raakblad"

msgid "Touchpad found."
msgstr "Raakblad gevind."

msgid ""
"Try again in a minute. If this stays, use Save problem details in Get help."
msgstr ""
"Probeer oor 'n minuut weer. As dit bly, gebruik Stoor probleembesonderhede in"
" Kry hulp."

msgid "Try again later."
msgstr "Probeer later weer."

msgid "Try anyway"
msgstr "Probeer tog"

msgid "Try it first"
msgstr "Probeer dit eers"

msgid "Turn automatic updates off or on"
msgstr "Skakel outomatiese bywerkings af of aan"

msgid "Turn it on"
msgstr "Skakel dit aan"

msgid ""
"Turn it on below, and computers on your Home network can open the folders you"
" pick."
msgstr ""
"Skakel dit hieronder aan, en rekenaars op u Tuis-netwerk kan die gidse wat u "
"kies, oopmaak."

msgid "Turn it on from a Home network."
msgstr "Skakel dit aan vanaf 'n Tuis-netwerk."

msgid "Turn off"
msgstr "Skakel af"

msgid "Turn on"
msgstr "Skakel aan"

msgid "Turn on anyway"
msgstr "Skakel tog aan"

msgid ""
"Turn on automatic updates or automatic disk unlock, or free up disk space"
msgstr ""
"Skakel outomatiese bywerkings of outomatiese skyfontsluiting aan, of maak "
"skyfspasie vry"

msgid ""
"Turn sharing off and on again. If this stays, use Save problem details in Get"
" help."
msgstr ""
"Skakel deling af en weer aan. As dit bly, gebruik Stoor probleembesonderhede "
